        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story of “one summer” of youth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Witness the destiny that awaits you beyond your interaction with the heroine!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story changes according to the choices you make!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story changes depending on the hero's choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can enjoy more than 200,000 words of text and more than 5 multiple endings!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 50 illustration stills!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can enjoy the illustrations that color the story at various points in the scenario.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depending on your choice or route, the illustrations may change...?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The “a” (alpha) version, which is the first version to appear on steam, comes with a short novella “Wait for white clouds,” which is a story from the past of the main game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wait for white clouds“ contains major spoilers for ”summer reunion&quot;, so we recommend that you play it after clearing the main game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895700/extras/71078dedf84fc2f5768192af2eb79388.avif?t=1757602883\" width=1122 height=462 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895700/extras/8f0828d64e4492cb0838bc1a218e24e7.avif?t=1757602883\" width=1122 height=462 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895700/extras/f5a1c42a5139869625338f26fc307e6c.avif?t=1757602883\" width=1122 height=462 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895700/extras/4038c6fa51df7b8c0e197e6758e8a34d.avif?t=1757602883\" width=1122 height=462 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story of “one summer” of youth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Witness the destiny that awaits you beyond your interaction with the heroine!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story changes according to the choices you make!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story changes depending on the hero's choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can enjoy more than 200,000 words of text and more than 5 multiple endings!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 50 illustration stills!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can enjoy the illustrations that color the story at various points in the scenario.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depending on your choice or route, the illustrations may change...?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The “a” (alpha) version, which is the first version to appear on steam, comes with a short novella “Wait for white clouds,” which is a story from the past of the main game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wait for white clouds“ contains major spoilers for ”summer reunion&quot;, so we recommend that you play it after clearing the main game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895700/extras/71078dedf84fc2f5768192af2eb79388.avif?t=1757602883\" width=1122 height=462 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895700/extras/8f0828d64e4492cb0838bc1a218e24e7.avif?t=1757602883\" width=1122 height=462 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895700/extras/f5a1c42a5139869625338f26fc307e6c.avif?t=1757602883\" width=1122 height=462 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895700/extras/4038c6fa51df7b8c0e197e6758e8a34d.avif?t=1757602883\" width=1122 height=462 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
